  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Putting Children First 1V BRIDGING YEAR FUND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant bridges the PCF IV grant (ICD 1160) and ends on 30 June 2023. Putting Children First - Transition Phase (July 2022-June 2023) carries over activities from PCF IV and consolidates learning with a view to have a potential successor to the current project. The project is being implemented by 3 consortium partners namely Mavambo Orphan Care Trust (ZIM613), Mashambanzou Care Trust 612) and St Alberts Mission Hospital CHBC (ZIM611) 
 The project looks at protection issues, and inclusive programming and at the same time building resilient communities through livelihoods , IGAs, claiming one&apos;s rights and access to services.</narrative>
  </description>
